---
title: Aidan's Travel Notes and Other Projects
summary: Travel thoughts and photographs, as well as other projects.
description: Travel writing and photographs from places I have visited.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /index.html
---
<section class="opening" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="measure">
    <p class="kicker">Journeys and photographs</p>
    <h1 id="page-title">Aidan's Travel Notes and Other Projects</h1>
    <p class="lede">Thoughts and photographs from places I have visited. In addition, some personal hobby projects are also detailed</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="trips" class="essay measure" aria-labelledby="trips-title">
  <h2 id="trips-title">Trips</h2>
  <div class="trip-list">
    {% for trip in collections.trips | reverse %}
      <article class="trip-card">
        <h3><a href="{{ trip.url | htmlBaseUrl }}">{{ trip.data.title }}</a></h3>
        <p>{{ trip.data.summary }}</p>
      </article>
    {% else %}
      <p>No trips have been added yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
